Subject: clutter: Add function clutter_frame_clock_get_frame_count

Bug: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/issues/4254
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2121195
Origin: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/4612
---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.c | 6 ++++++
 clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.h | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.c b/clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.c
index 6207f9a..01129c3 100644
--- a/clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.c
+++ b/clutter/clutter/clutter-frame-clock.c
@@ -1935,3 +1935,9 @@ clutter_frame_clock_set_passive (ClutterFrameClock       *frame_clock,
 
